WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:05.620
Since we learned that Mew Aqua should
be found under the grounds of Tokyo,

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:10.150
we exhausted ourselves day after day searching for it, just to stay ahead of the enemy.

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:16.220
Meanwhile, thanks to everyone’s support,
I made a date with Aoyama-kun.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.220
However, that afternoon....

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.660
<i>Stop it! No matter what!</i>

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:23.160
<i>If we fail, Tokyo will be destroyed!</i>

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:41.460
Hmm, as expected,
it’s in the loamy layer.

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:45.600
Hey, can I go to Tokyo Tower?

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:46.830
For what?

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:49.270
You know, it looks like it’s going to be an exciting show!

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:52.640
You’ll have to be more practical if you want to succeed.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.380
Don’t be like Quiche. He’s frivolous.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.320
Geez.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.850
Now, look for the Mew Aqua.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:05.750
Drive more carefully.
Dangerous! Dangerous!

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.380
Buckle up!

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:27.710
Excuse us.

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:28.730
Please get out of our way.

00:01:29.670 --> 00:01:31.230
<i>Pollutants?</i>

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:36.650
<i>Yes. Keiichirou says it’ll probably hatch today.</i>

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:41.160
<i>Once it hatches, it’ll keep spreading
the pollutants all over Tokyo.</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:45.660
<i>How did you find out about the cocoon on Tokyo Tower?</i>

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:50.130
<i>Masha happened to pass by, when his sensor detected it.</i>

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:54.090
<i>Masha thought it was an error, but...</i>

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:56.440
<i>Regardless, just remove the cocoon!</i>

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:58.050
<i>We will.</i>

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:03.930
But why did they put it at such a noticeable place?

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:12.500
Senpai!

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.380
Yeah?

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:15.750
Umm, thank you very much.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:19.360
You mean the tickets?
It should be I who thanks you.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:23.520
Although, I didn’t think
you wanted them.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:24.790
Did it work?

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.010
Yes.

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:30.890
Well, I didn’t know you’re so daring.
Your fangirls will be in tears!

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:32.190
It’s not like that...

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.760
Yeah, it’s okay.
Let me meet her someday.

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:43.030
Where’s the cocoon?

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.060
This building is too big!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:51.060
Akasaka-san!

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:53.670
We have no time left.

00:02:53.670 --> 00:02:56.230
The Chimera Anima that is supposedly carrying pollutants

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.890
...is on the lightning rod on the roof.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:01.390
Welcome, ladies!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.260
Wah! You again!

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:05.910
Quiche!

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:08.680
Heh, I thought you’d come here.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:11.380
You are so predictable.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:13.100
Shut up!

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.300
Oh no, a ploy by the enemy to divert our attention!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:20.670
I fear they have located a Mew Aqua at a remote site.

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:24.320
Come on. The clock is ticking,
the moth will hatch soon...

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:25.890
What are you going to do?

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:30.310
Mama, I just saw a person flying!

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:33.650
Attack! Either way, the cocoon has to be destroyed.

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.650
Alright!

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:40.640
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:49.150
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:57.800
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.950
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:23.050
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:09.180
Ryou, close the Tower’s observation deck.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.260
We have no time to waste.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.730
Leave it to me!

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:24.300
Hey, is it really here?

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:26.780
Don’t be hasty. We will find it soon.

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:30.140
Aw, Quiche should be having fun now.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:42.590
There it is!

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.840
Finally you’ve come.

00:05:48.840 --> 00:05:54.120
Well, I’ll forgive you. Girls need more
time to prepare for a date.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.580
Now, isn’t it refreshing to stand at this altitude?

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:00.230
Yeah, it’s refreshing!

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:02.690
Chills are running up
and down my spine.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:05.780
Now isn’t the time for that.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:08.550
Hey, Quiche! I won’t let the moth hatch!

00:06:09.240 --> 00:06:12.680
Again today, for the Earth’s future, I’ll be of service! ~Nya!

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.180
StrawberBell!

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:18.550
Dragon Swords!

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:41.110
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.790
Can’t be... Strawberry Surprise didn’t work?!

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:55.890
Hey, you should hurry, or it’ll hatch!

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:05.760
I guess I’ve come too early.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:19.200
<i>Thank you for visiting. The observation
deck is now closed for maintenance.</i>

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:16.640
We are sorry.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.200
Why are you suddenly changing your business hours?

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:22.820
<i>We hope you will visit us again.</i>

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:23.350
What’s the result?

00:07:23.350 --> 00:07:27.110
I am sorry. I should’ve figured it out earlier.

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:31.940
The cocoon was most likely intended to distract us.

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:33.300
The true goal of the enemy is...

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:34.910
The Mew Aqua?

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:40.850
Yes. As suspected, they were searching for
the Mew Aqua using Chimera Animas.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:44.300
Now, I will maximize Masha’s detection range.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.360
Chimera Ahima! Chimera Anima!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:51.490
Detected. The Chimera Anima is underground, 20 km NW from here.

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.020
Keep monitoring it.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:57.370
We have to handle the cocoon first.

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:02.850
Alright! *l* will attack now!

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:03.580
Wait.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:05.730
Why?

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:12.150
It’s futile. The cocoon is working as a barrier. The moth isn’t sustaining any damage.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:15.470
By attacking him, we’re just needlessly
exhausting ourselves.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:18.430
What’s wrong?! You know, you’ll run out of time!

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:20.660
But, if we do nothing...

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.420
Ignore his provocation.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.870
We’ll have a chance,
when the moth starts hatching.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.280
Aoyama-kun

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:37.030
Aoyama-kun...

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:46.750
What are you doing?!

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:51.670
The show is about to begin.
You should switch off your mobile!

00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:54.910
<i>Well... are you free today?</i>

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:59.780
<i>Great! Then I’ll be waiting for you in the station plaza at 5.</i>

00:08:59.780 --> 00:09:07.040
You have to keep your promise.
You can probably still make it in time.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:07.900
Mew Mint...

00:09:08.540 --> 00:09:10.500
I bet you’ll make it in time!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.260
With us working together,
it’d be a breeze!

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.140
Everyone!

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:19.280
That’s not how it works.

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:24.250
Still haven’t found it?

00:09:25.020 --> 00:09:26.650
Something is strange.

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:28.730
How so?

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:32.900
Are you sure that Chimera Anima detected a Mew Aqua?

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:36.240
He’s not digging in a constant direction.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:37.760
But Quiche said...

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.850
Oh, he’s returned!

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:45.200
He seems to have found it.

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.430
Let me have a look!

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:53.790
What are you doing?!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.470
These are common gems!

00:09:55.960 --> 00:10:00.410
They didn’t have any ability to detect
the Mew Aqua to begin with!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.260
Eh? That means...

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:05.690
Idiot! What the heck is he thinking?

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:10.670
You good-for-nothing!

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:13.610
Ryou!

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:15.550
The Chimera Anima has disappeared.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:16.090
What?

00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.150
Instead, the energy over our head is increasing.

00:10:19.150 --> 00:10:20.050
It’s hatching!

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.560
I guess it’s time now.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.810
Wuahh! It’s coming out!

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.650
Now! Before it flies away! Follow me!

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:53.730
Zakuro’s Whip!

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:54.550
Mew Pomegranate!

00:10:57.190 --> 00:11:00.800
Reborn... Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:19.450
We did it!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.190
Ugh! It’s about to fly!

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.080
Don’t let it go!

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:39.920
Reborn... PuddingRings INFERNO!!

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:41.760
Hey, wait!

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.310
Eat this! PuddingRings Inferno!

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.460
I won’t let you pass.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:12:00.070
Reborn... Lettuce RUSH!!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:10.830
You’re not going anywhere!

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:16.590
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:28.810
Reborn... Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:45.030
NO!!!

00:12:58.650 --> 00:12:59.630
Mew Strawberry!

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.310
Reborn Strawberry...

00:13:14.700 --> 00:13:16.270
I can’t let you do that.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:32.830
<i>Aoyama-kun, I want to see you!</i>

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:38.750
Ichigo!

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:40.250
Mew Strawberry!

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:59.500
How do you always show up like this?

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:03.460
I was born only to protect you.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:04.840
But, the one I love is...

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:09.720
I don’t mind. Loving someone is noble.

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:14.160
Love overcomes any difficulties,
and opens a future.

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:23.400
Hey, did you come to interfere again?!

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:27.670
The rest will depend on you.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:34.020
You’re running away? Hrmph!
It’s all over for you anyway,

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:37.980
everyone in Tokyo, including
the one Ichigo loves!

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:44.230
I won’t let you...

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:46.800
I won’t let you!

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:51.160
I won’t let you do such a thing.

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:54.160
Never!

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:55.120
I won’t let you!

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:12.990
This energy potential is...

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:14.030
What is this?

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:14.780
Ryou!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:17.810
Shirogane’s not in!
He left with the suitcase!

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:23.330
<i>Keiichirou, that is...</i>

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:26.780
<i>Yes, this is the one we unearthed
at the archaeological site.</i>

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:29.010
<i>Do you think it’ll work?</i>

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.030
<i>Not sure.</i>

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.280
Wait! Wait!

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:38.560
Over there!

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.750
That’s Mew Strawberry...

00:15:40.430 --> 00:15:43.560
She’s glowing!
The Mew Aqua must be near her!

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:46.920
How? There wasn’t any reaction there earlier.

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:51.200
I suppose it reacts only when you’re emotionally moved.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:54.140
Mew Strawberry.

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.140
Ichigo-san.

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:57.100
Quiche, what are you going to do?

00:15:57.950 --> 00:15:59.980
As I thought, it is here.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:03.940
Now! Come here, Mew Aqua!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:13.010
<i>Ryou, this isn’t a diversion after all.</i>

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.700
What the heck are they going to do?

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:20.660
Pollutants are being released!

00:16:20.660 --> 00:16:22.310
It’s all over.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:23.600
Don’t give up.

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:24.940
We mustn’t let it go!

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:33.380
Ichigo, take the Mew Aqua!

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:40.160
Everyone...

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:41.140
You are stubborn!

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.100
It’s too late to use your
barrier to stop it.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.940
But, I’ll give you a last chance!

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:06.080
Please... Mew Aqua!

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:07.880
Mew Strawberry!

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:10.380
Use this!

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:15.550
This is...

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:20.680
Mystic words are coming,
from the bottom of my heart...

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:26.420
<i>O Virga Mew Aquæ, luce!</i>

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:33.930
<i>Reborn Aquæ Guttæ!</i>

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:36.490
Ichigo!

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:37.570
Mew Strawberry!

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:39.030
Ichigo-oneechan!

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:40.500
Mew Strawberry...

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.860
Quiche, you betrayer!

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.010
This is no time for arguing!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.870
I’ve been waiting for this!

00:18:07.710 --> 00:18:08.760
What?

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:23.270
Ryou!

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:29.440
Keiichirou... I must glorify them!

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.240
Sure. They are wonderful goddesses.

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:40.950
Ouch!

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:43.370
Quiche!

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:48.210
You bastard! Do you know what you are doing?

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.550
Deep Blue-sama!

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:57.740
Deep Blue-sama, this is how Mew Aqua works.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.050
This is...

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:06.220
You should need this...

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:07.700
this power...

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:11.360
...for your true awakening!

00:19:18.990 --> 00:19:20.990
Are you alright, Mew Strawberry?

00:19:20.990 --> 00:19:22.570
My compliments to you... this time.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:24.910
Ichigo-oneechan is awesome!

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:27.620
Thank you, your help was great.

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:29.830
Is this your new item?

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:32.710
Oh, Mew Pudding, don’t play with that.

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:36.400
Oh... So beautiful.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:40.970
Go now.

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:46.300
You have to go there, even though
he may have already gone home.

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:47.770
Zakuro-san.

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:50.620
It’s important. Hurry!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.080
Yes!

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:04.410
Aoyama-kun... I’m sorry.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:20.850
Aoyama-kun...

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:27.160
Aoyama-kun, I’m sorry.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:30.250
But I can’t tell you why I’m late.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:34.040
Ah, Aoyama-kun,
so you’re waiting for me?

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:37.570
But, I’m afraid you hate me now.

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:40.160
Eh? What?

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:42.030
Aoyama-kun? What did you say now?

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:45.140
Could it be that...?

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:49.850
Next: “I Love You: Aoyama-kun’s Shocking Declaration.”

00:20:49.850 --> 00:20:53.280
I can’t believe this.
This isn’t a dream, is it?
